---
description: Local agent resource and verification workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the Local agent workflow in AGENTS.md. Use an isolated worktree,
focused local tests through scripts/ci.sh, and scripts/app_driver.py for
headless app checks. Full PR checks run in GitHub CI. Do not open windows on
the user's display unless requested or needed for native desktop behavior.
One task, one commit: squash a branch's intermediate commits before handing
the work back (see Committing in AGENTS.md).
